From 9f621cd8e41f1ca4bbc5417b2ba7697fd63799d8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Devaney <patrickbdevaney@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:38:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] deepseek41 : Engram O_DIRECT row-store input
 (LLAMA_ENGRAM_ROWFILE_DIR)

Serve the two ~101 GB Engram tables from packed 264 B-row side files
(llamacpp/ENGRAM_ROWFILE.md) with O_DIRECT preads, bit-exact FP8 x E8M0 dequant rounded
to bf16 as the reference does. The GGUF then carries no engram_embd tensors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
